cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software archive and the associated paper."
title: "TETRIS-seq: duplex error-corrected sequencing pipeline for SNV, indel, CNV, FLT3-ITD and translocation detection"
abstract: >-
  Bioinformatic pipeline for processing duplex-UMI error-corrected targeted
  sequencing data, including single-strand (SSCS) and duplex (DCS) consensus
  calling, variant calling and annotation, an in silico beta-binomial noise
  correction model, and detection of SNVs, indels, copy-number alterations,
  FLT3-ITDs, KMT2A-PTDs and translocations.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Watson
    given-names: Caroline J.
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8351-268X"
  - family-names: Blundell
    given-names: Jamie R.
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"   # TODO: set to your release date
